 0.70 0.34 0.04 0
 0.80 0.50 0.00 0
 1.00 1.00 0.00 0 /
SOLUTION
EQUIL
 2000 200 2100 0 /
SCHEDULE
WELSPECS
 INJ G 13 10 2000 WATER /
 PROD G 26 10 2000 OIL /
/
COMPDAT
 INJ 13 10 1 5 OPEN 1* 1* 0.2 /
 PROD 26 10 1 5 OPEN 1* 1* 0.2 /
/
WCONINJE
